  "question": "Where can I find a hospital that fall inside a 90 kilometers boundary to the southwest of Hasley Canyon Equestrian Center, Valencia, CA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-118.636206 34.452191)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-118.636206 34.452191)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND amenity = 'hospital'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 202.5 AND 247.5;\n",
